sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor RM as Retail Manager
    participant UI as Web Client
    participant API as Express Server
    participant DB as PostgreSQL DB

    Note over RM, DB: 1. Go to Datasets Page & Select Completed Dataset
    RM->>UI: Open Datasets page (/dashboard/datasets)
    UI->>API: GET /api/datasets
    API->>DB: Query user's datasets
    API-->>UI: Return datasets list
    RM->>UI: Select a completed dataset ("View Report")

    Note over RM, DB: 2. View Analysis Overview & Section Purposes
    UI->>API: GET /api/reports/:datasetId/overview
    API->>DB: Aggregate sentiment, product & aspect stats
    API-->>UI: Return executiveOverview, actionMatrix & aspectPerformance
    UI-->>RM: Render Analysis Report Sections
    Note over RM, UI: Executive Overview: Total reviews, health score & sentiment split\nAspect Performance: Pos/Neu/Neg breakdown per product aspect\nProduct Action Matrix: Groups products into Star, Needs Attention, Mixed

    Note over RM, DB: 3. Product Action Matrix & Product Detail Drilldown
    UI->>API: GET /api/reports/:datasetId/product-matrix
    API->>DB: Query filtered & sorted product matrix
    API-->>UI: Return categorized product list
    RM->>UI: Click a specific product row
    UI->>API: GET /api/reports/:datasetId/product/:productName
    API->>DB: Query summary, aspect drivers, word cloud & quotes
    API-->>UI: Return product detail analytics
    UI-->>RM: Display Product Detail Page (Drivers, Word Cloud & Quotes)
